      <Comment source="PMN, zhang, SRI, caspi">This branched unsaturated fatty acid has been reported from the bacterium |FRAME: TAX-1063| |CITS: [25092314]|. Like other fatty acids, |FRAME: CPD-18204| is rarely found in its free form. It is usually found as either an acyl-[acp] form or |FRAME: E-11-methyl-12-octadec-12-enoate-lipid &quot;incorporated into a lipid&quot;|.</Comment>
